    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm grading some high school history essays and need some help. one student wrote an essay arguing that \"national identity is a necessary tool for social cohesion and should be prioritized over globalist integration.\" can you critique the logic of this argument for me? i want to give them some feedback on where their reasoning might be weak.",
