      "content": "That's an interesting way to frame it. You mentioned that nationalism can \"undermine essential rights\" and that \"progressive global engagement\" is a more \"compelling\" perspective. Why would you characterize global engagement as \"progressive\" in this context, and why is that viewed as more compelling than the student's focus on social cohesion?",
